WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.394
Miss Gray: Okay, Room Two. Here are the rules.

2
00:00:05.395 --> 00:00:08.864
Miss Gray: It's boys against girls.

3
00:00:08.865 --> 00:00:15.368
Mark: Oh yeah!

4
00:00:15.369 --> 00:00:18.565
Miss Gray: Everyone has to hold on to the rope.

5
00:00:18.566 --> 00:00:22.160
Miss Gray: Each team tries to pull the other team over the line.

6
00:00:22.161 --> 00:00:24.424
Miss Gray: We'll play three rounds.

7
00:00:24.425 --> 00:00:28.898
So your team has two chances to win.

8
00:00:28.899 --> 00:00:37.154
Mark: We're going to win three times!

9
00:00:37.155 --> 00:00:39.014
Coby: Maybe.

10
00:00:39.015 --> 00:00:46.421
Miss Gray: I expect good manners—from losers [i@and@i] winners. Got it?

11
00:00:46.422 --> 00:00:48.363
Kids: Got it!

12
00:00:48.364 --> 00:01:09.743
Miss Gray: Okay then. Ready, set, go!

13
00:01:09.744 --> 00:01:13.144
Mark: Ugh! The girls are winning!

14
00:01:13.145 --> 00:01:15.080
Pull harder!

15
00:01:15.081 --> 00:01:18.606
Jim: I'm pulling as hard as I can!

16
00:01:18.607 --> 00:01:27.001
Coby: Me too!

17
00:01:27.002 --> 00:01:31.681
Kara: Ha-ha! The girls beat the boys!

18
00:01:31.682 --> 00:01:33.839
Mark: Be quiet, Kara!

19
00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:38.585
We're going to win the next game!

20
00:01:38.586 --> 00:01:39.968
Miss Gray: Kara and Mark!

21
00:01:39.969 --> 00:01:43.914
I'd like to see you now!

22
00:01:43.915 --> 00:01:46.523
Miss Gray: I do not like what I am hearing.

23
00:01:46.524 --> 00:01:49.381
Miss Gray: What did I say at the start of the game?

24
00:01:49.382 --> 00:01:52.890
Mark: You want to see good manners from losers.

25
00:01:52.891 --> 00:01:55.350
Miss Gray: And . . .?

26
00:01:55.351 --> 00:01:57.169
Kara: From winners.

27
00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:03.542
Miss Gray: Right. I hope that's what I see from now on.

28
00:02:03.543 --> 00:02:07.779
Mark: Come on, guys. We have to win this time!

29
00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:16.628
Coby: Grab the rope, everybody.

30
00:02:16.629 --> 00:02:21.194
Mark: Tug harder! We're—

31
00:02:21.195 --> 00:02:24.867
Kara: Miss Gray! Mark just stepped over the line!

32
00:02:24.868 --> 00:02:26.716
Mark: No, I didn't!

33
00:02:26.717 --> 00:02:29.208
Kara: Yes, you did!

34
00:02:29.209 --> 00:02:30.494
Miss Gray: Mark, sit down.

35
00:02:30.495 --> 00:02:34.375
You're out of the game!

